  "description": "§4.2 (TS18) element store: the worked example - arrived[0] = 65530 (u16) plus 10 arrivals gives 65540 >= 0xFFFF, so all twelve values become u32 and element 4 := 65540; a later small write keeps u32; a missing property is created as 12 u16 zeros; 0xFFFF itself promotes; a short array reads 0 and is replaced [choice]. Then ApplyTrafficToDestination off the map: the pool of A's road connection at (-1, 5) counts the arrivals (max 50); the connection's own holder gets count added to element lastTravelType (car = 1) of 0xAA9EA81A + type and the pool's new total in element 4 + type; at 55 >= 50 the destination bit 0 of (-1, 5) is cleared and freeDest[0] drops. Freight (type 3) writes no arrival array but still the total in element 7. A travel type the cell's connection types do not carry (passenger train) finds no holder: nothing.",
